---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Shuruudaha — Somwave"
  description="Shuruudaha isticmaalka websaydka iyo adeegyada Somwave."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-600">Sharciga</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Shuruudaha adeegga</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Isticmaalka somwave.com, app.somwave.com, iyo adeegyada la xidhiidha waxay ka dhigan tahay inaad
      aqbashay shuruudahan.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Adeegyada</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Mashruuc kasta waxaa lagu qeexaa qandaraas ama xisaab rasmi ah. Portal-ku wuxuu muujiyaa
      xogta kuu gaar ah; waa inaadan gelin akoon qof kale.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Lacag bixinta</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Biilasha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa USD. Hababka bixinta (EVC Plus iyo kuwa kale) waxaa lagu caddeynayaa
      biilka marka la diyaariyo.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Xadka masuuliyadda</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Waxaan ku dadaalnaa in adeeggu yahay mid sugan, laakiin kama dammaanad qaadno inuu weligiis
      shaqeeyo iyada oo aan kala go’ lahayn.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/nala-soo-xiriir"
      class="mt-10 inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-surface hover:bg-primary-600"
    >
      Su’aal? Nala soo xiriir
    </a>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
